    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92664" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοΐζω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππον, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοή</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>water a horse,
				ride</i> him <i>in a pond</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοΐσαντα εἰς ὕδωρ γλυκύ</span>”
